        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Pokémon held item that boosts a move\nused consecutively. Its effect is\nreset if another move is used.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Pokémon held item that boosts a move\nused consecutively. Its effect is\nreset if another move is used.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "もたせると　おなじわざを　れんぞくで\nつかったとき　いりょくが　あがる。\nやめると　いりょくは　もどる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "지니게 하면 똑같은 기술을 연속으로\n사용했을 때 위력이 올라간다.\n그만두면 위력이 되돌아간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Objet à tenir. Booste une capacité utilisée\nà répétition. L’effet s’annule si une autre\ncapacité est utilisée.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Item zum Tragen. Verstärkt eine Attacke,\nje öfter sie in Folge ausgeführt wird.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mejora los PS de base, pero reduce la\nVelocidad en combate. Debe llevarla un\nPokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Strumento da dare a un Pokémon.\nPotenzia una mossa usata più volte di seguito.\nIl potenziamento svanisce al cambio di mossa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nIt boosts moves used consecutively,\nbut only until a different move is used.",
