      "text": "Strumento da dare a un Pokémon.\nPotenzia una mossa usata più volte di seguito.\nIl potenziamento svanisce al cambio di mossa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. It boosts moves\nused consecutively but only until a different move\nis used.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "持たせると　同じ技を　連続で\n使ったとき　威力が　あがる。\nやめると　威力は　もどる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "携带后，连续使出相同招式时，\n威力就会提高。不再使出\n相同招式时，威力就会复原。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Potencia un movimiento que se use de forma\nconsecutiva. Pero el efecto se pierde si se emplea otro\nmovimiento.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
